### LegalFlow — jeu de requêtes pour tester l'API (GET / POST / PUT / PATCH / DELETE)
### Utilise l'extension "REST Client" de VS Code, ou adapte en curl.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@email = client@example.com
@password = pass12345

### 1. Créer un compte client
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "first_name": "Badr", "role": "client" }

### 2. Login → récupérer le token JWT
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@access = {{login.response.body.access}}

### 3. Profil courant
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 4. POST — créer une société
# @name createCompany
POST {{base}}/api/companies/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme SAS", "legal_form": "SAS", "share_capital": "1000.00" }

@companyId = {{createCompany.response.body.id}}

### 5. GET — liste des sociétés
GET {{base}}/api/companies/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 6. GET — détail
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 7. PUT — remplacer
PUT {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme SASU", "legal_form": "SASU", "share_capital": "500.00" }

### 8. PATCH — modifier un champ
PATCH {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "en_revue" }

### 9. POST — créer un document rattaché
# @name createDoc
POST {{base}}/api/documents/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company": {{companyId}}, "doc_type": "statuts" }

@docId = {{createDoc.response.body.id}}

### 10. POST — demander la signature (génère un OTP, renvoyé en dev via otp_code_debug)
# @name reqSig
POST {{base}}/api/documents/{{docId}}/request-signature/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### 11. POST — vérifier l'OTP → document signé
POST {{base}}/api/documents/{{docId}}/verify-signature/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "{{reqSig.response.body.otp_code_debug}}" }

### 12. DELETE — supprimer la société
DELETE {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
